---
// HomeExperience.astro - Section principale d’orientation et de conversion (4 cartes)
---

<section id="experiences" class="pt-12 sm:pt-16 pb-12 sm:pb-16 border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 scroll-mt-10" aria-labelledby="experiences-heading">
  <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 sm:mb-12">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-400">
      Formules & Pratique
    </p>
    <h2 id="experiences-heading" class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif font-medium text-gray-950 dark:text-gray-100 mt-2">
      Choisir votre expérience
    </h2>
    <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 font-serif mt-2.5 leading-relaxed">
      Quatre manières de découvrir ou d’approfondir la calligraphie chinoise à Lyon, adaptées à votre démarche.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
    
    <!-- 1. Ateliers collectifs -->
    <article class="group bg-white dark:bg-gray-800/90 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 border border-gray-200/90 dark:border-gray-700/80 shadow-2xs hover:shadow-md hover:border-indigo-300 dark:hover:border-indigo-700 transition flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-400">
            En groupe
          </span>
          <span class="text-[11px] text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500 font-serif">Lyon 4<sup>e</sup></span>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-medium text-gray-950 dark:text-gray-100 group-hover:text-indigo-600 dark:group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">
          Ateliers collectifs
        </h3>

        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 font-serif mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          Apprenez la calligraphie chinoise en groupe, dans une atmosphère conviviale.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 font-serif italic">
          Au Dojo Zen & chez Miroirs du Ciel
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700/60">
        <a
          href="/cours-collectifs"
          class="w-full py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl bg-gray-950 hover:bg-gray-800 text-white dark:bg-gray-100 dark:text-gray-950 dark:hover:bg-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium transition text-center inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-indigo-500">
          <span>Voir les ateliers</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 2. Cours individuels -->
    <article class="group bg-white dark:bg-gray-800/90 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 border border-gray-200/90 dark:border-gray-700/80 shadow-2xs hover:shadow-md hover:border-indigo-300 dark:hover:border-indigo-700 transition flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-400">
            Sur mesure
          </span>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400">Crédit 50 %</span>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-medium text-gray-950 dark:text-gray-100 group-hover:text-indigo-600 dark:group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">
          Cours individuels
        </h3>

        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 font-serif mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          Un accompagnement personnalisé, adapté à votre niveau et à votre rythme.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 font-serif italic">
          À domicile sur toute la métropole lyonnaise
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700/60">
        <a
          href="/cours-individuel-a-domicile"
          class="w-full py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700 bg-stone-50 hover:bg-stone-100 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium transition text-center inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-indigo-500">
          <span>Découvrir les cours individuels</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 3. Interventions -->
    <article class="group bg-white dark:bg-gray-800/90 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 border border-gray-200/90 dark:border-gray-700/80 shadow-2xs hover:shadow-md hover:border-indigo-300 dark:hover:border-indigo-700 transition flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-400">
            Structures
          </span>
          <span class="text-[11px] text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500 font-serif">Sur site</span>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-medium text-gray-950 dark:text-gray-100 group-hover:text-indigo-600 dark:group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">
          Interventions
        </h3>

        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 font-serif mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          Écoles, entreprises, associations et maisons de retraite : des ateliers adaptés à votre public.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 font-serif italic">
          Matériel complet apporté sur votre site
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700/60">
        <a
          href="/atelier-de-groupe"
          class="w-full py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700 bg-stone-50 hover:bg-stone-100 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium transition text-center inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-indigo-500">
          <span>Organiser une intervention</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 4. Œuvres à vendre -->
    <article class="group bg-gradient-to-b from-stone-50 to-white dark:from-gray-800 dark:to-gray-800/90 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 border border-indigo-200/80 dark:border-indigo-900/60 shadow-2xs hover:shadow-md hover:border-indigo-400 dark:hover:border-indigo-600 transition flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-400">
            Œuvres originales
          </span>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400">Pièces uniques</span>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-medium text-gray-950 dark:text-gray-100 group-hover:text-indigo-600 dark:group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">
          Œuvres à vendre
        </h3>

        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 font-serif mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          Découvrez les calligraphies originales disponibles à l’acquisition.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-indigo-950 dark:text-indigo-300 font-serif font-medium">
          Pièces uniques à l’encre de Chine disponibles sur demande directe.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-indigo-100 dark:border-indigo-900/40">
        <a
          href="/galerie"
          class="w-full py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl bg-indigo-700 hover:bg-indigo-800 text-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium transition text-center inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 shadow-2xs focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-indigo-500">
          <span>Découvrir les œuvres</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </article>

  </div>
</section>
